Bhai, sabse pehle toh is math ko thoda simplify kar lete hain.

Dhyan se dekho: a[i] * x + a[i] * y ko hum seedha a[i] * (x + y) likh sakte hain. Isse tumhari calculation fast ho jayegi aur code clean dikhega.

Kyunki yeh ek single index i par update (Point Update) hai, toh iske liye tumhe apne Segment Tree ke template ko ek line bhi change karne ki zarurat nahi hai! Tumhare paas 2 tarike hain isko handle karne ke:

Tarika 1: solve() function mein new value calculate karke pass karo (Best & Recommended)
